Package: fastphylosig
Type: Package
Title: Fast Phylogenetic Signal Statistics
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:
    person("Yin", "Wen", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "yinwen-ecology@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Computes selected phylogenetic signal statistics with R wrappers
    and RcppArmadillo kernels. Continuous-trait Blomberg's K and Pagel's lambda
    follow phytools::phylosig() for se = NULL, binary Fritz and Purvis D follows
    caper::phylo.d(), and categorical Delta uses accelerated discrete
    ancestral-state likelihoods. The package is designed for repeated
    calculations on a shared tree, explicit tree/data matching, trait-wise
    missing-data handling, and validation against reference implementations.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    ape,
    parallel,
    Rcpp,
    stats
LinkingTo:
    Rcpp,
    RcppArmadillo
Suggests:
    caper,
    phytools,
    testthat
URL: https://github.com/yinwen-ecology/fastphylosig,
    https://yinwen-ecology.github.io/fastphylosig/
BugReports: https://github.com/yinwen-ecology/fastphylosig/issues
SystemRequirements: C++11, OpenMP (optional)
